@startuml user-journey
title User Journey - Anti Dispatch (macOS Dynamic Island & Workspace Orchestrator)

skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Developer as Dev
participant "Notch HUD / Menu Bar" as HUD
participant "Launcher Engine\n(LauncherService)" as Launcher
participant "Git Worktree Engine\n(GitWorktreeService)" as GitService
participant "Antigravity IDE\n(Electron Instance)" as IDE
participant "CDP Monitoring Engine\n(CDPService)" as CDP

== 1. Skenario Standby & Peluncuran Proyek (Single Project) ==
Dev -> HUD : Klik "Open Project..."
activate HUD
HUD -> HUD : Tampilkan Native NSOpenPanel
Dev -> HUD : Pilih direktori proyek ~/work/my-app
HUD -> Launcher : launch(workspaceURL: ~/work/my-app)
activate Launcher
Launcher -> Launcher : Generate Path Hash & Target Data-Dir\n(~/.antigravity-multi/a1b2c3_my-app)
Launcher -> Launcher : Scan Port Bebas (misal: 9221)
Launcher -> IDE : Launch Process (--remote-debugging-port=9221\n--user-data-dir=~/.antigravity-multi/...)
activate IDE
Launcher --> HUD : Return PID
deactivate Launcher
HUD -> CDP : Start Monitoring(port: 9221, PID)
activate CDP

== 2. Pemantauan Sesi Aktif di Notch (Glanceable HUD) ==
loop Polling Adaptif (800ms saat RUNNING / 3000ms saat IDLE)
    CDP -> IDE : WebSocket CDP: Runtime.evaluate (DOM Query)
    IDE --> CDP : Return { state: "RUNNING", headline: "Analyzing auth.ts", subSteps: [...] }
    CDP -> HUD : Update Live State Model
    HUD -> HUD : Render Animasi Notch (Cyan Glow: "Thinking... 4s")
end

== 3. Skenario Multi-Worktree / Branch Baru ==
Dev -> HUD : Klik "Open New Branch..."
HUD -> HUD : Buka Modal Form BranchCreatorSheet
Dev -> HUD : Input: Branch "feat/oauth", Base: "main"
HUD -> GitService : prepareWorktree(branch: "feat/oauth", in: repoURL)
activate GitService
GitService -> GitService : Git rev-parse & worktree add ~/work/my-app-feat-oauth
GitService --> HUD : Return Target Worktree URL
deactivate GitService
HUD -> Launcher : launch(workspaceURL: ~/work/my-app-feat-oauth, branch: "feat/oauth")
activate Launcher
Launcher -> Launcher : Scan Port Bebas Baru (9222)
Launcher -> IDE : Launch Instance 2 (--remote-debugging-port=9222\n--user-data-dir=~/.antigravity-multi/x9y8z7_my-app_feat_oauth)
activate IDE
Launcher --> HUD : Return PID 2
deactivate Launcher
HUD -> CDP : Register Session 2 (Port 9222)
HUD -> HUD : Beralih ke Mode Accordion Multi-Session (2 Active Agents)

== 4. Interaksi Fokus & Penutupan Sesi ==
Dev -> HUD : Klik Card Sesi Proyek
HUD -> IDE : Activate Window via NSRunningApplication
Dev -> HUD : Klik "x" (Close Instance)
HUD -> IDE : Terminate Process PID
HUD -> CDP : Stop CDP Connection
HUD -> HUD : Re-render Notch Layout
deactivate IDE
deactivate CDP
deactivate HUD

@enduml
